  [Ensure inclusive and equitable quality education and promote lifelong learning opportunities for all.],
  [The summer camp at Vivekananda College of Engineering and Technology, Puttur, organized with Akanksha Charitable Trust and TCS, provided rural students with practical training in HTML, CSS, Canva, Office Tools, G-Suite, and the Sustainable Development Goals. Guidance on higher education, career opportunities, and hackathon participation supported Target 4.4 by building relevant digital and problem-solving skills.],
